# mGBA suite: select "DMA tests" (menu entry 9) and run it.
# Menu wraps, so 5 UP presses from entry 0 land on entry 9.
# The menu polls keys once per VBlank, so each key is held 2 frames
# and presses are spaced 6 frames apart.
30 press UP
32 release UP
36 press UP
38 release UP
42 press UP
44 release UP
48 press UP
50 release UP
54 press UP
56 release UP
60 press A
62 release A
